staurant, the A&amp;E waiting room...</i><br><br><i>You'll meet moderately humorous characters such as: a creepy clown, your boring boss, an obsessive stamp collector...</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2404190/extras/9a3f79261136caa5978659ef078e5cdc.poster.avif?t=1686425592\" width=615 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2404190/extras/9a3f79261136caa5978659ef078e5cdc.webm?t=1686425592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>...Honestly, just go play something else.", "short_description": "&quot;Why would you waste your time making this? Couldn't you have made something fun instead? Games are supposed to be fun...&quot; - The Game Developer's Dad", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2404190/header.jpg?t=1686425592", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2404190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1686425592", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2404190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1686425592", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Gr